/svg\" width=\"1.511ex\" height=\"0.036ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 668 16\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(167,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(334,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(501,0)\"></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 3 bond pair and 1 lone pair in a molecule then angle between bonds 107<sup>o</sup>.\n<br><br>(3) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.511ex\" height=\"0.036ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 668 16\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(167,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(334,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(501,0)\"></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 2 bond pair and 2 lone pair in a molecule  then angle between bonds 104.5<sup>o</sup> \n<br><br>(4) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.511ex\" height=\"0.036ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 668 16\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(167,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(334,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(501,0)\"></g></g></g></svg></mjx-c